(globalThis.TURBOPACK||(globalThis.TURBOPACK=[])).push(["object"==typeof document?document.currentScript:void 0,324551,(e,r,t)=>{r.exports=JSON.parse('{"categories":[{"id":10000,"name":"Memoirs of Grand Gaia","description":"While traveling in Grand Gaia, cooperating with friends and with a powerful goddess, a Summoner faces off against demons in fierce battles.","order":1},{"id":10100,"name":"Mistral","description":"Guided by Tilith, who serves the god Lucius, the Summoner starts a great adventure. The Four Fallen Gods must be defeated, starting with Maxwell.","parent":10000,"order":1},{"id":10101,"name":"Cordelica","description":"An island once inhabited by giants seems to be this Summoner\'s next stop. However, the Imperial Guard\'s Paris is also headed towards Cordelica...","parent":10000,"order":2},{"id":10102,"name":"Palmyna","description":"The Summoner arrives to the land Cardes the Malevolent seeks to destroy. A new battle commences where the legendary 4 Heroes of Palmyna once stood.","parent":10000,"order":3},{"id":10103,"name":"Lizeria","description":"Paris arrives to the island of the ancient La Veda Republic to search for a rumored gate, but the Summoners\' Hall has already begun investigation.","parent":10000,"order":4},{"id":10104,"name":"Agni Region","description":"Zevalhua the Supreme must be slain before he destroys everything. He is said to be in a quarrel with Afla Dilith, one of the Four Fallen Gods.","parent":10000,"order":5},{"id":11001,"name":"Morgan","description":"While Karl goes after the demon Graham, the Summoner seeks to challenge Maxwell\'s disciple, Abaddon. But can Abaddon really be defeated?","parent":10100,"order":2},{"id":11002,"name":"St. Lamia","description":"The land under Creator Maxwell\'s jurisdiction is the new destination. The goal is to head towards Maxwell\'s stronghold, St. Lamia Palace, with Tilith.","parent":10100,"order":3},{"id":11010,"name":"Amdahl","description":"The Summoner touches down where the great Amdahl Empire once prospered. Tilith expects this journey to end in Cardes the Malevolent\'s defeat.","parent":10102,"order":1},{"id":11011,"name":"Encervis","description":"According to Tilith, this land was once witness to a human civil war. Intense battles begin breaking out in the midst of the wilderness.","parent":10102,"order":2},{"id":11040,"name":"Ryvern","description":"Zevalhua the Supreme has become the new target. Tilith mentions that she is afraid a plot may be afoot.","parent":10104,"order":1},{"id":11041,"name":"Agni","description":"The land where an empire once stood tall is now visited by the Summoner. Grahdens has entrusted you and Lugina with Karl\'s rescue, but...","parent":10104,"order":2},{"id":11042,"name":"Mirvana","description":"Having finally reached Zevalhua\'s stronghold, it\'s time for this old battlefield to give way for a new fight to rescue a captured Grahdens.","parent":10104,"order":3},{"id":20000,"name":"A New Region","description":"The Summoner is asked to venture into a newly discovered and mysterious land. However, the enemies waiting there prove a lot stronger than imagined...","order":3},{"id":50000,"name":"Memoirs of Grand Quest","description":"It is said that the Grand Quest System built by the Akras Summoners\' Hall Survey Office allows one to experience the same adventure in numerous ways.","order":7},{"id":50100,"name":"Dawn of the Summoner","description":"The Grand Quest System allows Summoners to relive any adventures already experienced in different lands, facing off against gods and demons alike...","parent":50000,"order":1},{"id":51000,"name":"Demonic Agitation","description":"Karl asks the Summoner for some help with defeating a certain dragon. This particular beast is quick to flee, so they try a pincer attack, but...","parent":50100,"order":1},{"id":51001,"name":"Proud Soldier\'s Feast","description":"Lugina and the Summoner search for the Empress\'s treasure hidden within the Great Tree of Life. However, Paris is also after the treasure herself.","parent":50100,"order":2},{"id":51002,"name":"Cobalt Spirit\'s Waking","description":"Seria and Karl ask the Summoner for help with defeating the demon Graham. However, Graham has several traps in store for them...","parent":50100,"order":3},{"id":51003,"name":"The Crimson God\'s Cry","description":"After learning of the demon Algmos\'s sighting, Seria ignores orders from Summoners\' Hall and pursues the demon. Now the Summoner must bring her back.","parent":50100,"order":4},{"id":51004,"name":"The Old Dawn General","description":"Grahdens asks the Summoner for help with defeating the demon Mashreed. However, a number of other demons seem to be lurking in the area as well...","parent":50100,"order":5},{"id":51005,"name":"Lin\'s Long Day","description":"Lin asks the Summoner for help with conducting some land surveys in a region connected to Grand Gaia. Lots of monsters start showing up though, and...","parent":50100,"order":6},{"id":51006,"name":"Virtual Garden","description":"Paris visits a strange land upon Noel\'s request, and the Summoner goes in the same direction. Going their separate ways they run into unexpected foes.","parent":50100,"order":7},{"id":51007,"name":"Warped Reflection","description":"Lugina and the Summoner set off to defeat a demon, all according to Noel\'s plan. However, Lugina is then forced to fight a demon that resembles him.","parent":50100,"order":8}],"scenarios":[{"id":10001,"title":"Start of the Journey","description":"Tilith explains Grand Gaia\'s situation in the Cave of Flames. The Summoner must embark on a far and long journey to defeat the Four Fallen Gods...","category":10100,"order":2,"script":"map1-dungeon1","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":20,"at":"start"}},{"id":10002,"title":"Unit Compatibility","description":"At Egor Snowfield, Tilith mentions the importance of Elements regarding Units. Thunder beats Water, etc... A good thing to consider for future fights.","category":10100,"order":3,"script":"map1-dungeon2","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":30,"at":"start"}},{"id":10003,"title":"Equipment Matters","description":"The Summoner reaches the Forest of Beasts, where enemies hunt wild animals for food. The usage of Spheres is carefully explained here as well.","category":10100,"order":4,"script":"map1-dungeon3","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":40,"at":"start"}},{"id":10004,"title":"Battle Technique","description":"The humidity in Magutagal Wetlands puts Tilith in a bad mood, though she does shed light on the Sparks created by multiple synchronized attacks.","category":10100,"order":5,"script":"map1-dungeon4","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":50,"at":"start"}},{"id":10005,"title":"Leadership","description":"Tilith is impressed that the Summoner has been able to reach Mirza\'s Remains safely. As a reward, she explains the benefits of using Leader Skills.","category":10100,"order":6,"script":"map1-dungeon5","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":60,"at":"start"}},{"id":10006,"title":"I\'m Not Afraid!","description":"Rumors say that a mysterious swordsman lurks in the Monster\'s Nest. Though Tilith swears she\'s not afraid, she looks pretty scared indeed...","category":10100,"order":7,"script":"map1-dungeon6","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":70,"at":"start"}},{"id":10007,"title":"Mistral Liberated","description":"Now at the Tower of Mistral, the liberation of the whole region is but a step away. However, Creator Maxwell has built quite a terrifying opponent...","category":10100,"order":8,"script":"map1-dungeon7","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":80,"at":"start"}},{"id":10008,"title":"Onto New Lands","description":"The Summoner successfully defeats the Juggernaut, earning Tilith\'s praise. Lucius will now open the way towards the unknown land of Morgan.","category":10100,"order":9,"script":"map1-ending","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":80,"at":"end"}},{"id":10009,"title":"Reunion with Karl","description":"Searching for Tilith, our Summoner enters the Kagan Desert. A coincidental meeting with Karl reveals that he is after the demon Graham.","category":11001,"order":1,"script":"map2-dungeon1","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":200,"at":"start"}},{"id":10010,"title":"Beautiful Swordswoman","description":"At Breeze Beach Tilith hears of a beautiful, yet indifferent swordswoman. However, she\'s confident that she\'s much prettier than this rumored beauty.","category":11001,"order":2,"script":"map2-dungeon2","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":210,"at":"start"}},{"id":10011,"title":"Graham\'s Subordinate","description":"Karl hurts himself while pursuing Graham. The Nocturnal Forest is said to be the turf of one of Graham\'s subordinates who is attacking many Summoners.","category":11001,"order":3,"script":"map2-dungeon3","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":220,"at":"start"}},{"id":10012,"title":"Karl\'s Pursuit","description":"Karl is successful in driving out Graham from the Nocturnal Forest. With nowhere to run, it\'s time to settle everything in the Asekutt Wastelands.","category":11001,"order":4,"script":"map2-dungeon4","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":230,"at":"start"}},{"id":10013,"title":"Abaddon & Graham","description":"Seria, a member of the Demon Slayers, shows herself at the Shrine of Lystia. According to her, Graham is one of Abaddon\'s most treasured underlings.","category":11001,"order":5,"script":"map2-dungeon5","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":240,"at":"start"}},{"id":10014,"title":"Refusal","description":"Seria goes belligerent on the Summoner. Though Karl wants to continue to the Destroyed Cathedral as a team of three, Seria\'s not making it easy...","category":11001,"order":6,"script":"map2-dungeon6","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":250,"at":"start"}},{"id":10015,"title":"For My Comrades","description":"Having finally reached Abaddon\'s stronghold in the Tower of Morgan, Karl and Seria fend off incoming enemies to help the Summoner press forward.","category":11001,"order":7,"script":"map2-dungeon7","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":260,"at":"start"}},{"id":10016,"title":"To the Enemy Base","description":"Abaddon has been defeated. After meeting Karl and once again parting ways, Tilith and the Summoner head towards St. Lamia in search of Maxwell.","category":11001,"order":8,"script":"map2-ending","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":260,"at":"end"}},{"id":10017,"title":"No Slacking Off!","description":"At Volcano Eldent, Tilith warns that ignoring one\'s duties is unacceptable. She says she has never slacked off when it comes to her job, but...","category":11002,"order":1,"script":"map3-dungeon1","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":300,"at":"start"}},{"id":10018,"title":"A Bad Omen","description":"Though Tilith tries to give some background on Sacred Mt. Craylia, she doesn\'t seem to be doing very well. She has supposedly caught a cold...","category":11002,"order":2,"script":"map3-dungeon2","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":310,"at":"start"}},{"id":10019,"title":"Bluffing","description":"Tilith tries her best to pretend her condition is not aggravating while in the Blood Forest. But it\'s clear to see it\'s taking a toll on her...","category":11002,"order":3,"script":"map3-dungeon3","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":320,"at":"start"}},{"id":10020,"title":"The Curse","description":"Tilith finally confesses about her bad physical condition in Mt. Wistorea. Maxwell\'s curse affects her even more as she approaches St. Lamia Palace.","category":11002,"order":4,"script":"map3-dungeon4","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":330,"at":"start"}},{"id":10021,"title":"A Promise","description":"At the Secluded Sanctuary, Tilith finally collapses. Entrusting her to Seria, the Summoner heads towards St. Lamia Palace alone to vanquish the curse.","category":11002,"order":5,"script":"map3-dungeon5","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":340,"at":"start"}},{"id":10022,"title":"Something to Protect","description":"After being rescued by Karl, the Summoner goes after Maxwell in St. Lamia Palace. Can Tilith truly be saved from this terrible curse?!","category":11002,"order":6,"script":"map3-dungeon7","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":360,"at":"start"}},{"id":10023,"title":"Fall of the Creator","description":"With the curse broken, Tilith comes back to her normal self, but somehow ends up in a dramatic argument with Seria...","category":11002,"order":7,"script":"map3-ending","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":360,"at":"end"}},{"id":10100,"title":"The Plot Begins","description":"Once Eriole learns that the Akras Summoners\' Hall has opened the southern region of Mistral, he send Paris to Cordelica...","category":10101,"order":1,"script":"map4-open","trigger":{"kind":"land","archiveId":2,"at":"start"}},{"id":10101,"title":"Demon Slayer Lugina","description":"An encounter with the Demon Slayer Lugina occurs in Greskya Caves. Since he has no respect for the Regular Army, he demands that the Summoner leave.","category":10101,"order":2,"script":"map4-dungeon1","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":20000,"at":"start"}},{"id":10102,"title":"Elgaia Affairs","description":"At Ignia Falls, Lugina sheds light on how both the Randall Empire and the Akras Summoners\' Hall influence life in Elgaia.","category":10101,"order":3,"script":"map4-dungeon2","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":20010,"at":"start"}},{"id":10103,"title":"The Summoner Army","description":"Lugina explains how the Summoner Army works while in Lomass Forest. And as an elite, he demands that the Summoner respect his authority.","category":10101,"order":4,"script":"map4-dungeon3","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":20020,"at":"start"}},{"id":10104,"title":"Paris\'s Request","description":"Paris shows herself in Valtan Fortress. She asks the Summoner for cooperation regarding the land survey on Cordelica, but...","category":10101,"order":5,"script":"map4-dungeon4","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":20030,"at":"start"}},{"id":10105,"title":"That Snob!","description":"While heading to the Tower of Light, Paris mentions that the Summoner is a friend of Karl\'s, but Lugina doesn\'t buy it. He doesn\'t seem fond of Karl.","category":10101,"order":6,"script":"map4-dungeon5","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":20040,"at":"start"}},{"id":10106,"title":"A Giant God","description":"Paris explains in the Cordelica Mine that a race of giants inhabited the island long ago. It would seem that the god of the giants has awaken as well.","category":10101,"order":7,"script":"map4-dungeon6","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":20050,"at":"start"}},{"id":10107,"title":"Enthusiastic Lugina","description":"While Lugina goes on a mission to defeat the giant god Grantos in the Giant\'s Ruins, Paris asks the Summoner to demonstrate what real power is.","category":10101,"order":8,"script":"map4-dungeon7","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":20060,"at":"start"}},{"id":10108,"title":"Eriole\'s Motives","description":"Having learned that the Summoner defeated Grantos, Eriole laughs while proclaiming that the world is heading towards the right direction...","category":10101,"order":9,"script":"map4-ending","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":20060,"at":"end"}},{"id":10200,"title":"Knight Supervisor","description":"Lucius guides the Summoner to the Palmyna Archipelago, while a certain man in Randall is informed that the barrier over the same islands has vanished.","category":11010,"order":1,"script":"map5-open","trigger":{"kind":"land","archiveId":3,"at":"start"}},{"id":10201,"title":"Cardes the Malevolent","description":"The next target is Cardes the Malevolent, another of the Four Fallen Gods. In Julep Village you hear that half of his power is still sealed away.","category":11010,"order":2,"script":"map5-dungeon1","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":400,"at":"start"}},{"id":10202,"title":"Road to Palmyna","description":"Tilith claims not to be scared aboard the Ghost Ship Legnia. However, she does give some information about Palmyna, where Cardes is sealed...","category":11010,"order":3,"script":"map5-dungeon2","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":410,"at":"start"}},{"id":10203,"title":"A Mysterious Man","description":"The Summoner is suddenly attacked by a strange man in Elios Plains. But this mysterious man\'s presence disappears just as fast as it showed itself.","category":11010,"order":4,"script":"map5-dungeon3","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":420,"at":"start"}},{"id":10204,"title":"His Name is Zebra","description":"A meeting with Seria and Karl in the Saji Mines reveals they are still after Graham. Karl warns the Summoner against someone called Zebra.","category":11010,"order":5,"script":"map5-dungeon4","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":430,"at":"start"}},{"id":10205,"title":"A Mysterious Elder","description":"Tilith and her Summoner run into \\"Elder Grah\\" in Lamellia Temple. The old man claims to be investigating the folklore linked to the Four Fallen Gods.","category":11010,"order":6,"script":"map5-dungeon5","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":440,"at":"start"}},{"id":10206,"title":"Unknown Force","description":"Karl and Seria corner Graham in Ghost Town Edila, but they are blown away by an unknown and powerful force, allowing Graham to escape.","category":11010,"order":7,"script":"map5-dungeon6","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":450,"at":"start"}},{"id":10207,"title":"Amdahl\'s Last Emperor","description":"Showing himself at Amdahl Castle, Elder Grah tells of the vengeful spirit of Amdahl\'s last emperor, which apparently still lurks about the castle.","category":11010,"order":8,"script":"map5-dungeon7","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":460,"at":"start"}},{"id":10208,"title":"Seria & Elder Grah","description":"Elder Grah is impressed with the Summoner\'s ability to vanquish the evil spirit. Seria rushes over, and it seems that she knows the elder somehow.","category":11010,"order":9,"script":"map5-ending","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":460,"at":"end"}},{"id":10209,"title":"Ruins of the Past","description":"Guided by Lucius, the Summoner reaches Encervis. According to Tilith, a human civil war ravaged this land a long time ago.","category":11011,"order":1,"script":"map6-open","trigger":{"kind":"area","archiveId":500,"at":"start"}},{"id":10210,"title":"Hardworking Tilith","description":"After reaching Elsta Crater, Tilith tells the Summoner how hard she\'s been working so far. However, her claims seem questionable somehow...","category":11011,"order":2,"script":"map6-dungeon1","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":500,"at":"start"}},{"id":10211,"title":"The Sky Fort Restored","description":"Zebra suddenly attacks at Lake Aldela, but Elder Grah\'s assistance prevents any serious damage. This powerful enemy seems to live in a floating fort.","category":11011,"order":3,"script":"map6-dungeon2","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":510,"at":"start"}},{"id":10212,"title":"Amdahl\'s History","description":"Elder Grah tells of the history of Amdahl while wondering about Castle Avenia. He asks the Summoner to destroy the sky fort, but Tilith\'s apathetic...","category":11011,"order":4,"script":"map6-dungeon3","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":520,"at":"start"}},{"id":10213,"title":"Zebra & a Dark Figure","description":"Zebra and the Dark Figure are found in the Gadillian Ravine talking about how to handle the Summoner. Just what could their relationship be...?","category":11011,"order":5,"script":"map6-dungeon4","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":530,"at":"start"}},{"id":10214,"title":"Reassuring Support","description":"Seria and Karl search for the Summoner at Alman Mausoleum. They both say they want to use their power to help bring down the sky fort.","category":11011,"order":6,"script":"map6-dungeon5","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":540,"at":"start"}},{"id":10215,"title":"Penetrating the Fort","description":"In the Land of the Dead, Tilith reveals that the sky fort\'s official name is Solaris. She intends to use her powers to help infiltrate it.","category":11011,"order":7,"script":"map6-dungeon6","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":550,"at":"start"}},{"id":10216,"title":"Zebra vs. Tilith","description":"Thanks to Tilith\'s powers, the infiltration of Sky Fort Solaris is a success. Zebra sees this as an opening to attack the exhausted goddess.","category":11011,"order":8,"script":"map6-dungeon7","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":560,"at":"start"}},{"id":10217,"title":"Zebra & Grahdens","description":"Zebra has finally been defeated. However, he destroys Solaris trying to bring the Summoner down with him. Who can prevent this tragedy...?","category":11011,"order":9,"script":"map6-ending","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":560,"at":"end"}},{"id":10218,"title":"The Battlefield","description":"The Summoner reaches Palmyna through Lucius\'s guidance. Traces of a kingdom which fought against the gods are still very much apparent here.","category":10102,"order":1,"script":"map7-open","trigger":{"kind":"area","archiveId":600,"at":"start"}},{"id":10219,"title":"The Unraveling Seal","description":"Though initially in Obselion Castle, Tilith heads to Dejour Ruins in a hurry to warn that the seal on Cardes has begun to wear off.","category":10102,"order":2,"script":"map7-dungeon1","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":600,"at":"start"}},{"id":10220,"title":"4 Heroes of Palmyna","description":"Grahdens is left alone with the Summoner at Obselion Castle. He shares the story of the 4 Heroes of Palmyna who sealed Cardes the Malevolent away.","category":10102,"order":3,"script":"map7-dungeon2","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":610,"at":"start"}},{"id":10221,"title":"Eccentric Seria","description":"At Emerald Path, Seria and Karl learn that they must travel to the spirit world in order to defeat Cardes. Seria is acting rather strange though...","category":10102,"order":4,"script":"map7-dungeon3","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":620,"at":"start"}},{"id":10222,"title":"The Gods\' Rampage","description":"While passing through the Grandelt Ruins, Tilith reveals that Cardes\'s body is slowly disintegrating, and that his godly powers are running rampant.","category":10102,"order":5,"script":"map7-dungeon4","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":630,"at":"start"}},{"id":10223,"title":"Grahdens\'s Doubts","description":"In Arlind Seminary, Grahdens expresses his doubts regarding the past and recent movements of the gods. His thoughts seem to influence the Summoner.","category":10102,"order":6,"script":"map7-dungeon5","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":640,"at":"start"}},{"id":10224,"title":"The Entrance to Hades","description":"Karl and Seria accompany the Summoner to the gates of the underworld in the Noera Battleground. They are both worried about Tilith.","category":10102,"order":7,"script":"map7-dungeon6","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":650,"at":"start"}},{"id":10225,"title":"Battling Cardes","description":"The Summoner and the others split up to find Cardes in the Spirit World of Palmyna. Can he be defeated before he destroys everything?","category":10102,"order":8,"script":"map7-dungeon7","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":660,"at":"start"}},{"id":10226,"title":"The Goddess Reborn","description":"Just when everyone tries to escape the now crumbling underworld, Seria suffers an injury. In this desperate situation, Tilith appears to save the day.","category":10102,"order":9,"script":"map7-ending","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":660,"at":"end"}},{"id":10300,"title":"The Search","description":"After hearing Paris\'s report, Eriole dispatches her to Lizeria. What could he possibly be looking for?","category":10103,"order":1,"script":"map8-open","trigger":{"kind":"land","archiveId":4,"at":"start"}},{"id":10301,"title":"Lugina\'s Mission","description":"Lugina shows up in Erinecht Plains and claims to have a mission much more important than that of the Summoner\'s. His feisty attitude hasn\'t changed.","category":10103,"order":2,"script":"map8-dungeon1","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":700,"at":"start"}},{"id":10302,"title":"An Ambition for Two","description":"After reaching Golzo Mountains, it is revealed that Paris is in search of a dormant power in Lizeria. And it seems Lugina is after the same thing.","category":10103,"order":3,"script":"map8-dungeon2","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":710,"at":"start"}},{"id":10303,"title":"Lugina\'s Training","description":"At Lodan Frozen Lake, Lugina wrongly assumes that Paris has betrayed the Summoner. Everything is clarified, but Lugina insists on training...","category":10103,"order":4,"script":"map8-dungeon3","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":720,"at":"start"}},{"id":10304,"title":"The Hall\'s Dark Side","description":"Paris talks about the social structure of Elgaia while in the Impassable Marshlands. It feels like she distrusts the power of the Summoners\' Hall.","category":10103,"order":5,"script":"map8-dungeon4","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":730,"at":"start"}},{"id":10305,"title":"Lugina\'s Motivation","description":"In the Lightning Forest Zaljiba, Paris mentions the dark side of the Summoners\' Hall. Lugina is then questioned about it, and he answers accordingly.","category":10103,"order":6,"script":"map8-dungeon5","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":740,"at":"start"}},{"id":10306,"title":"Paris\'s Motivation","description":"Paris shares her doubts about the gods and talks about the world\'s instability in Lost City La Veda. She wants to take matters into her own hands.","category":10103,"order":7,"script":"map8-dungeon6","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":750,"at":"start"}},{"id":10307,"title":"Last Warning","description":"Atop the Black Bridge, Lugina says he will crush anyone who gets in his way, and makes one last confession to the Summoner before moving forward.","category":10103,"order":8,"script":"map8-dungeon7","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":760,"at":"start"}},{"id":10308,"title":"Lugina\'s Defeat","description":"Though Lugina loses to the Summoner, he claims that there is no way he could have failed, and continues to deny his own defeat.","category":10103,"order":9,"script":"map8-dungeon7-2","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":760,"at":"end"}},{"id":10309,"title":"Paris\'s Resolution","description":"At the Tower of Destruction, an injured Paris still refuses to give up on the dormant power in the region. She won\'t forgive the Summoner\'s intrusion.","category":10103,"order":10,"script":"map8-dungeon8","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":770,"at":"start"}},{"id":10310,"title":"Destructive Power","description":"A defense system capable of destroying Summoners. However, whatever Paris is looking for, which should\'ve been close, is nowhere to be seen...","category":10103,"order":11,"script":"map8-ending","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":770,"at":"end"}},{"id":10400,"title":"Double Journey","description":"Tilith and the Summoner set off to defeat Zevalhua the Supreme. Unbeknownst to them, Eriole and Paris are on their way to Agni as well...","category":11040,"order":1,"script":"map9-open","trigger":{"kind":"land","archiveId":5,"at":"start"}},{"id":10401,"title":"Comrades","description":"In Glomore Hollow, Karl and Seria state they want to help defeat Zevalhua while a mysterious woman scornfully watches from afar.","category":11040,"order":2,"script":"map9-dungeon1","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":800,"at":"start"}},{"id":10402,"title":"Karl\'s Past","description":"After reaching Snow Area Khelne, Disciple Mare suddenly appears and asks Karl to meet her in the Azura Ruins alone to reveal a certain secret to him.","category":11040,"order":3,"script":"map9-dungeon2","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":810,"at":"start"}},{"id":10403,"title":"Disciple Mare","description":"Seria worries about Karl while wondering in Stokhelna Forest when Mare shows herself again to say that Karl has played right into her hands...","category":11040,"order":4,"script":"map9-dungeon3","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":820,"at":"start"}},{"id":10404,"title":"Trapped Seria","description":"Seria falls into Mare\'s trap in the Azura Ruins, and suffers an injury. Tilith leaves Karl\'s rescue in the Summoner\'s hands while she cares for Seria.","category":11040,"order":5,"script":"map9-dungeon4","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":830,"at":"start"}},{"id":10405,"title":"Grahdens & Karl","description":"Grahdens awaits the Summoner in the Ryvern Mountains and shares his memories of Karl. He says he will get himself captured by Mare to break Karl out.","category":11040,"order":6,"script":"map9-dungeon5","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":840,"at":"start"}},{"id":10406,"title":"Stealthy Tilith","description":"Mare shows herself in front of the lone Summoner within the Abyss Cave. Just as she prepares to launch an attack, Tilith returns and prevents it.","category":11040,"order":7,"script":"map9-dungeon6","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":850,"at":"start"}},{"id":10407,"title":"Granvalm the White","description":"Mare unleashes Granvalm on the Summoner in the White Tower, and escapes. However, Tilith won\'t let her get away so easily.","category":11040,"order":8,"script":"map9-dungeon7","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":860,"at":"start"}},{"id":10408,"title":"Unexpected Helper","description":"Mare appears once again after having defeated Granvalm, and in the midst of this dire situation, an unforeseen ally saves everyone\'s hides...","category":11040,"order":9,"script":"map9-ending","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":860,"at":"end"}},{"id":10409,"title":"Be Grateful","description":"Lugina saves the Summoner in Ryvern to honor Grahdens\'s request. He also insists that he was asked to help with Karl\'s rescue.","category":11041,"order":1,"script":"map10-open","trigger":{"kind":"area","archiveId":900,"at":"start"}},{"id":10410,"title":"Lugina\'s Best Effort","description":"In the Agni Empire, Lugina is very excited about the rescue mission. He claims it\'s the perfect chance to complete his mission and make fun of Karl.","category":11041,"order":2,"script":"map10-dungeon1","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":900,"at":"start"}},{"id":10411,"title":"Mobilizing Again","description":"Tired of waiting for Mare to make an appearance, Lugina leaves the Summoner in Agniria Coast and goes off to search for Karl on his own...","category":11041,"order":3,"script":"map10-dungeon2","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":910,"at":"start"}},{"id":10412,"title":"Mare the Trickster","description":"Mare finally shows herself at Granasta Plateau. But she is not willing to fight. Instead, she demands that the Summoner follow her to save Karl.","category":11041,"order":4,"script":"map10-dungeon3","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":920,"at":"start"}},{"id":10413,"title":"Mare\'s Memories","description":"Mare has flashbacks of a certain person who fought in the war against the gods while the anguished Summoner chases her into Thunder Summit Navara.","category":11041,"order":5,"script":"map10-dungeon4","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":930,"at":"start"}},{"id":10414,"title":"Opposing Forces","description":"The Summoner advances into the King\'s Tomb without losing hope of rescuing Karl. Mare cannot understand such obstinacy, leading her to finally strike.","category":11041,"order":6,"script":"map10-dungeon5","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":940,"at":"start"}},{"id":10415,"title":"Counterattack","description":"Just when Mare is about to deal her finishing blow in Lognea Cove, Seria, who was supposed to be gravely injured, jumps in to save the Summoner.","category":11041,"order":7,"script":"map10-dungeon6","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":950,"at":"start"}},{"id":10416,"title":"The Rescue","description":"A horde of enemies appears in Ocean Shrine Albina, leaving Seria and the Summoner in a bind. However, Lugina shows up with a freed Karl just in time.","category":11041,"order":8,"script":"map10-dungeon7","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":960,"at":"start"}},{"id":10417,"title":"Captured Grahdens","description":"Mare is finally defeated by the Summoner, but on a moment\'s notice, Paris appears to report that Grahdens has been taken captive.","category":11041,"order":9,"script":"map10-ending","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":960,"at":"end"}},{"id":10418,"title":"Ancient Battlefield","description":"The Summoner finally sets foot on Mirvana. Tilith explains that this was the setting of the bloodiest battle during the great war with the gods.","category":11042,"order":1,"script":"map11-open","trigger":{"kind":"area","archiveId":1000,"at":"start"}},{"id":10419,"title":"Search Party Assemble","description":"Grahdens has been captured by Zevalhua the Supreme. In order to save him, the Summoner and the others split into groups in the Cave of Darkness.","category":11042,"order":2,"script":"map11-dungeon1","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":1000,"at":"start"}},{"id":10420,"title":"Suspicious Actions","description":"In Arvest Snowfield, Paris wonders suspiciously about why the gods have taken Grahdens prisoner instead of just killing him right off the bat...","category":11042,"order":3,"script":"map11-dungeon2","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":1010,"at":"start"}},{"id":10421,"title":"Whose Summoner?","description":"While searching for Grahdens in Marleg Ocean of Trees, Paris invites the Summoner to join her cause once again. Tilith ends up interrupting though.","category":11042,"order":4,"script":"map11-dungeon3","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":1020,"at":"start"}},{"id":10422,"title":"Lugina & Seria","description":"Lugina chastises Paris in the Bog of Eternal Rain. However, just before things get worse, Seria joins the fun and gets into an argument with Lugina.","category":11042,"order":5,"script":"map11-dungeon4","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":1030,"at":"start"}},{"id":10423,"title":"Paris\'s Doubts","description":"Grahdens\'s location is confirmed after reaching Cape Narasta, and Paris questions why Lucius doesn\'t defeat the Four Fallen Gods himself.","category":11042,"order":6,"script":"map11-dungeon5","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":1040,"at":"start"}},{"id":10424,"title":"They Never Change","description":"Karl thanks Tilith when she discloses more information on Grahdens in the Mirvana Ruins. Lugina and Seria, however, continue their usual quarrel.","category":11042,"order":7,"script":"map11-dungeon6","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":1050,"at":"start"}},{"id":10425,"title":"Zevalhua the Supreme","description":"The whole group has reached the Tower of the Gods at last. Can they accomplish their goal of defeating Zevalhua the Supreme to rescue Grahdens?","category":11042,"order":8,"script":"map11-dungeon7","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":1060,"at":"start"}},{"id":10426,"title":"The Secret of Birth","description":"Grahdens shows himself and reveals the secret of Karl\'s birth. At the same time, Eriole suddenly makes an appearance, cutting in to talk to the elder.","category":11042,"order":9,"script":"map11-ending","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":1060,"at":"end"}},{"id":20000,"title":"Mountain Demon","description":"Lin from the Survey Office Bureau asks the Summoner to investigate Egor Mountains. They say an ice demon lies dormant there.","category":20000,"order":1,"script":"map1-dungeon_ex_open","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":370,"at":"start"}},{"id":20001,"title":"The Demon\'s Past","description":"Lin discusses Skramya\'s past. Legends say that the demon was sealed away by a hero after it tried to destroy the nation that wanted to manipulate it.","category":20000,"order":2,"script":"map1-dungeon_ex_clear","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":370,"at":"end"}},{"id":20002,"title":"Sticky & Slimy","description":"Lin asks the Summoner to survey Ignia Cavern. It seems that a demon has awoken there after the earthquakes in Cordelica...","category":20000,"order":3,"script":"map4-dungeon_ex_open","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":20070,"at":"start"}},{"id":20003,"title":"Lin\'s Dislikes","description":"The Summoner defeats the gigantic and uncontrollable demon. Lin sings the Summoner\'s praises, but her attitude changes completely all of the sudden...","category":20000,"order":4,"script":"map4-dungeon_ex_clear","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":20070,"at":"end"}},{"id":20004,"title":"Gigantic Demon","description":"Lin relays some information to the Summoner which states that Valmodora\'s Nest houses a demon within. She expects the Summoner to gather more details.","category":20000,"order":5,"script":"map6-dungeon_ex_open","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":670,"at":"start"}},{"id":20005,"title":"Mysterious Ruins","description":"The Summoner defeats Valmodora while surveying the location. It seems that the ruins were housing something gigantic indeed.","category":20000,"order":6,"script":"map6-dungeon_ex_clear","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":670,"at":"end"}},{"id":20006,"title":"Lin\'s Bad Premonition","description":"The Summoner can feel a tremendous power emanating from the bottom of Golzo Underground Lake. Lin has a bad feeling about it, but asks for a survey.","category":20000,"order":7,"script":"map8-dungeon_ex_open","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":780,"at":"start"}},{"id":20007,"title":"Fallen God Lagzal","description":"Lagzal, who lay dormant underground, was a god who sought to destroy humans. It seems Lin was quite worried about the Summoner during the expedition.","category":20000,"order":8,"script":"map8-dungeon_ex_clear","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":780,"at":"end"}},{"id":20008,"title":"Hidden in the Dungeon","description":"While passing through the Agni Dungeon, Lin asks the Summoner to subdue a certain \\"evil being\\" locked up inside of it.","category":20000,"order":9,"script":"map10-dungeon_ex_open","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":1070,"at":"start"}},{"id":20009,"title":"End of a Tyrant","description":"According to Lin, what had been locked inside was the ghost of a feared tyrant who was sealed away by his own retainers.","category":20000,"order":10,"script":"map10-dungeon_ex_clear","trigger":{"kind":"dungeon","archiveId":1070,"at":"end"}},{"id":50101,"title":"Karl\'s Request","description":"Karl asks the Summoner for help with defeating a dragon. However, apparently the beast is quick to flee from danger.","category":51000,"order":1,"script":"grand_01_op","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000000}},{"id":50102,"title":"Off to Slay the Dragon","description":"The Summoners split up to go after the dragon. According to Karl, it couldn\'t have gone too far.","category":51000,"order":2,"script":"grand_01_01","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000000}},{"id":50103,"title":"Repelling the Dragon","description":"After Karl suspects that the tremor happening means the Summoner drove away the dragon, his resolve towards the mission strengthens.","category":51000,"order":3,"script":"grand_01_02","music":"bf049_raid_boss.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000000}},{"id":50104,"title":"Chasing the Dragon","description":"Suspecting that the Summoner has fought away the dragon, Karl rejoices believing that now\'s their chance to corner it.","category":51000,"order":4,"script":"grand_01_03","music":"bf049_raid_boss.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000000}},{"id":50105,"title":"Seria Catches Up","description":"Seria has been chasing after the Summoner and Karl. After scolding the Summoner for \\"moving too slow,\\" she decides to go ahead and slay the dragon.","category":51000,"order":5,"script":"grand_01_04","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000000}},{"id":50106,"title":"Lin\'s Message","description":"The Summoner receives a message from Lin saying that Karl will be a little late to reach the rendezvous point at the Tower of Dark Clouds.","category":51000,"order":6,"script":"grand_01_05","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000000}},{"id":50107,"title":"Grand Gaia\'s Treasures","description":"Karl opens a treasure chest. Apparently there are many treasures still left in these parts after the great war with the gods.","category":51000,"order":7,"script":"grand_01_06","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000000}},{"id":50108,"title":"Karl Repels the Dragon","description":"Karl advances on his own and faces the dragon. The dragon flees as expected, but doesn\'t get very far.","category":51000,"order":8,"script":"grand_01_07","music":"bf049_raid_boss.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000000}},{"id":50109,"title":"Karl Chases the Dragon","description":"Karl chases the dragon after the Summoner has confronted it, but there are too many possibilities as to where it could\'ve gone.","category":51000,"order":9,"script":"grand_01_08","music":"bf049_raid_boss.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000000}},{"id":50110,"title":"The Dragon\'s Nest","description":"Karl finds the dragon\'s resting place, and blocks its entrance. The branches on the ground suggest its real nest may be in the Thunder Valley.","category":51000,"order":10,"script":"grand_01_09","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000000}},{"id":50111,"title":"Injured Karl","description":"Karl runs into the dragon unexpectedly. He tries to chase after the escaping dragon, but he\'s suddenly attacked from out of nowhere...","category":51000,"order":11,"script":"grand_01_10","music":"bf049_raid_boss.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000000}},{"id":50112,"title":"Medical Attention","description":"Seria injures herself during a heated battle against the dragon. She tells the Summoner to stand back, but...","category":51000,"order":12,"script":"grand_01_11","music":"bf049_raid_boss.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000000}},{"id":50113,"title":"The Chase Ends","description":"The Summoner decides that Seria\'s medical care takes priority over chasing after the dragon. Karl proposes they consider the mission complete for now.","category":51000,"order":13,"script":"grand_01_12","music":"bf049_raid_boss.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000000}},{"id":50114,"title":"The Chase Continues","description":"Seria and the Summoner challenge the dragon. However, Karl is injured and cannot chase after the beast, so he proposes they report back for now.","category":51000,"order":14,"script":"grand_01_13","music":"bf049_raid_boss.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000000}},{"id":50115,"title":"Slayed the Dragon!","description":"Seria and the Summoner lose the dragon just when it was almost beaten. However, they receive some important information from Karl via Lin.","category":51000,"order":15,"script":"grand_01_14","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000000}},{"id":50116,"title":"Seria VS. the Dragon","description":"Just when the dragon is about to roar, Karl lands a finishing blow. Now that the mission has been completed, they head back home, but...","category":51000,"order":16,"script":"grand_01_15","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000000}},{"id":50200,"title":"Unexpected Calling","description":"Lugina unexpectedly shows up and asks the Summoner to take on a mission together. They are to find the empress\'s hidden treasure.","category":51001,"order":1,"script":"grand_02_op","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000001}},{"id":50201,"title":"Three Paths","description":"The Summoner and Lugina split up and each take a different route towards the Great Tree of Life, while Paris follows a third route there.","category":51001,"order":2,"script":"grand_02_01","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000001}},{"id":50202,"title":"About the Empress","description":"Lin has some information about the empress for the Summoner. According to what is known about her today, she was a cold-blooded monarch...","category":51001,"order":3,"script":"grand_02_02","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000001}},{"id":50203,"title":"Finding Treasure","description":"The Summoner finds a treasure chest. A sound of what resembles the flick of a switch is heard, but nothing really happens...","category":51001,"order":4,"script":"grand_02_03","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000001}},{"id":50204,"title":"Treasure Contents","description":"After defeating a tough enemy, the Summoner finds a treasure chest. Inside is a stone fragment of some kind...","category":51001,"order":5,"script":"grand_02_04","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000001}},{"id":50205,"title":"Master Trap Maker","description":"As Lugina continues on his path, he remembers that the empress\'s sorcerer was her closest confidant, almost like her brother. Maybe he made these...","category":51001,"order":7,"script":"grand_02_05","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000001}},{"id":50206,"title":"Open the Chest","description":"After Lugina opens a treasure chest, a resounding rumble can be heard, as if something gigantic were in motion.","category":51001,"order":8,"script":"grand_02_06","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000001}},{"id":50207,"title":"Lugina Trapped","description":"Lugina finds a cave blocked by an iron barred gate. At that very moment, paralyzing gas is released and the gate opens.","category":51001,"order":9,"script":"grand_02_07","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000001}},{"id":50208,"title":"A Piece of Stone?","description":"After defeating a tough enemy, Lugina finds a treasure chest. The only thing inside is a stone fragment, but...","category":51001,"order":10,"script":"grand_02_08","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000001}},{"id":50209,"title":"Fury of the Empress","description":"As Paris reaches the Town in Ruins, she remembers a story that tells of the fearsome empress\'s nature.","category":51001,"order":12,"script":"grand_02_09","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000001}},{"id":50210,"title":"Three Headed Dragon","description":"Paris opens a treasure chest adorned with a three-headed dragon. What sounds like a switch being activated is heard, but nothing happens...","category":51001,"order":13,"script":"grand_02_10","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000001}},{"id":50211,"title":"Who Will Proceed?","description":"Paris finds a treasure chest with its seal already broken. Her guess is that Summoners\' Hall has sent personnel to search for the treasure as well.","category":51001,"order":14,"script":"grand_02_11","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000001}},{"id":50212,"title":"Broken Lithograph","description":"Paris manages to defeat a tough enemy, and earns the treasure chest guarded by the beast as her reward. Inside she finds a stone fragment of sorts.","category":51001,"order":15,"script":"grand_02_12","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000001}},{"id":50213,"title":"Treasure\'s Reflection","description":"The Summoner finally reaches the Great Tree of Life. There is no treasure to be found here, but words start appearing on the trunk of the Tree...","category":51001,"order":6,"script":"grand_02_13","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000001}},{"id":50214,"title":"Treasure\'s Greed","description":"Lugina finally reaches the Great Tree of Life. There is no treasure to be found here, but words start appearing on the trunk of the Tree...","category":51001,"order":11,"script":"grand_02_14","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000001}},{"id":50215,"title":"Treasure\'s Pain","description":"Paris finally reaches the Great Tree of Life. There is no treasure to be found here, but words start appearing on the trunk of the Tree...","category":51001,"order":16,"script":"grand_02_15","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000001}},{"id":50216,"title":"Last Trial","description":"The Summoner, Lugina, and Paris finally reach the Great Tree of Life. The three of them have brought their stone fragments, so the last trial begins.","category":51001,"order":17,"script":"grand_02_16","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000001}},{"id":50217,"title":"Empress\'s \\"Treasure\\"","description":"The party manages to clear the last trial. However, the treasure hidden by the empress doesn\'t turn out to be what they were expecting...","category":51001,"order":18,"script":"grand_02_17","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000001}},{"id":50300,"title":"Request for Help","description":"Karl and Seria receive some intel about the demon Graham\'s whereabouts and ask the Summoner for help. Seria doesn\'t think it\'ll help much though.","category":51002,"order":1,"script":"grand_03_op","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50301,"title":"Straightforward Favor","description":"The three Summoners approach Graham\'s location via separate routes. Seria states once again that the Summoner\'s help is unnecessary.","category":51002,"order":2,"script":"grand_03_01","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50302,"title":"Graham\'s Preliminaries","description":"Graham approaches the Summoner in a courteous manner, and decides to test the Summoner\'s power after deeming the same an interesting enough opponent.","category":51002,"order":3,"script":"grand_03_02","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50303,"title":"Worthy Playmate","description":"Whether he really means it or not, Graham claims the Summoner to be too much for him, and flees. He says there\'s someone else he wants to play with...","category":51002,"order":4,"script":"grand_03_03","music":"bf049_raid_boss.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50304,"title":"Demon\'s Punishment","description":"Graham scolds Karl for being late, and attacks him. Karl accepts Graham\'s challenge, though weary of his traps.","category":51002,"order":5,"script":"grand_03_04","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50305,"title":"Smells Like a Trap","description":"Graham congratulates Karl on his growth, as if mocking him, and quickly flees. Even if this is a trap, Karl is set on going after him.","category":51002,"order":6,"script":"grand_03_05","music":"bf049_raid_boss.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50306,"title":"Friends\' Foe","description":"Seria attacks Graham to avenge the comrades she\'s lost to his tricks. Graham says he knows nothing of it, claiming he usually kills countless humans.","category":51002,"order":7,"script":"grand_03_06","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50307,"title":"A Demon Calls","description":"Graham doesn\'t take Seria seriously, and leaves because he\'s supposedly bored. He challenges Seria to come after him.","category":51002,"order":8,"script":"grand_03_07","music":"bf049_raid_boss.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50308,"title":"The Best Trap Yet","description":"The Summoners manage to corner Graham, but it all works in accordance to his plans. The party then falls straight into his trap...","category":51002,"order":9,"script":"grand_03_08","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50309,"title":"Blown Away","description":"The Summoner and Seria are blasted off to separate locations full of powerful monsters. They try to go after Graham while Grahdens finds Karl\'s lance.","category":51002,"order":10,"script":"grand_03_09","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50310,"title":"Sneak Attack","description":"Graham, who\'s supposed to be waiting at the Coliseum Ruins, suddenly appears. The Summoner is able to somehow repel his sneak attack, but...","category":51002,"order":11,"script":"grand_03_10","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50311,"title":"Deception Loving Demon","description":"Graham shows himself to a grumbling Seria. He proceeds to tell her he loves her, but his definition of love is quite the twisted one...","category":51002,"order":14,"script":"grand_03_11","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50312,"title":"Another Provocation","description":"As Grahdens looks for Karl, Graham appears before him. Graham tries to provoke the Elder Summoner, but Grahdens counters by provoking him instead.","category":51002,"order":17,"script":"grand_03_12","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50313,"title":"Building Confidence","description":"Grahdens helps the unconscious Karl. He teaches Karl about the true meaning behind trusting someone, and leaves the rest up to the young Summoner.","category":51002,"order":18,"script":"grand_03_13","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50314,"title":"Signs of the Awakening","description":"Karl makes his way to the Coliseum Ruins, where Graham awaits. However, he feels like something within him has to come to life all of the sudden...","category":51002,"order":19,"script":"grand_03_14","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50315,"title":"The Real Graham","description":"The Summoner arrives to the Coliseum Ruins. Graham, who has been waiting, says he will get more serious now, and attacks suddenly.","category":51002,"order":12,"script":"grand_03_15","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50316,"title":"Unbeatable Demon","description":"Graham has supposedly been driven into a corner, but he manages to heal all his wounds in an instant and flees, leaving a terrible aura behind...","category":51002,"order":13,"script":"grand_03_16","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50317,"title":"First Place","description":"Seria arrives to the Coliseum Ruins. After Graham mocks her, he says he will be a bit harsher on her than usual...","category":51002,"order":15,"script":"grand_03_17","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50318,"title":"Unfulfilled Revenge","description":"Though Graham is supposedly cornered, he heals all his wounds in an instant. Seria tries to take him on again, but he manages to escape.","category":51002,"order":16,"script":"grand_03_18","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50319,"title":"Believing in Friendship","description":"After Karl arrives to Graham\'s lair he waits for his comrades before making a move, believing they are already on their way to help him.","category":51002,"order":20,"script":"grand_03_19","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50320,"title":"Power of Three","description":"Graham is surprised that the Summoner, Karl, and Seria were all able to arrive at the same time. Claiming he won\'t go easy on them, he attacks!","category":51002,"order":21,"script":"grand_03_20","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50321,"title":"Deepest Wish","description":"Graham heals his own wounds, but Karl sees through his facade. The attacks they landed on Graham were indeed successful.","category":51002,"order":22,"script":"grand_03_21","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50322,"title":"Before Celebrating","description":"The Summoners defeat Graham, but it seems like the demon knew of Karl\'s origins. Sensing a presence, Karl moves on his own.","category":51002,"order":23,"script":"grand_03_22","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50323,"title":"Graham\'s True Nature","description":"Karl follows the presence he felt and finds that Graham has survived somehow. The demon shows his true nature and comes after Karl!","category":51002,"order":24,"script":"grand_03_23","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50324,"title":"Friends\' Trust","description":"Graham is defeated without revealing what he knows about Karl. As Karl leaves the area still clouded by doubt, Seria and the Summoner show up.","category":51002,"order":25,"script":"grand_03_24","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000002}},{"id":50400,"title":"Seria\'s Recklessness","description":"The Summoner receives an urgent call from Lin. She says that Seria has run off after the demon Algmos all by herself after having heard of a sighting.","category":51003,"order":1,"script":"grand_04_op","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000003}},{"id":50401,"title":"Three Routes","description":"After Lin discloses the location of the demon, she mentions that she has asked other Summoners to help out as well, so the Summoner should seek them.","category":51003,"order":2,"script":"grand_04_01","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000003}},{"id":50402,"title":"Tilith\'s Protection","description":"The Summoner runs into Tilith by chance. After Tilith hears what Seria has done, she immediately agrees to go after her together.","category":51003,"order":3,"script":"grand_04_02","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000003}},{"id":50403,"title":"Meeting Elder Grah","description":"The Summoner runs into Grahdens by coincidence. Grahdens tells of Seria\'s ties with the demon, and agrees to go after her with the Summoner.","category":51003,"order":8,"script":"grand_04_03","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000003}},{"id":50404,"title":"Running into Lugina","description":"The Summoner runs into Lugina. After Lugina mocks Seria\'s course of action, he agrees to go after her to make fun of her in person.","category":51003,"order":13,"script":"grand_04_04","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000003}},{"id":50405,"title":"Seria\'s Ignorance","description":"Tilith and the Summoner find Seria, who is confronting Algmos. Seria is bent on facing the demon alone, but...","category":51003,"order":4,"script":"grand_04_05","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000003}},{"id":50406,"title":"Didn\'t Know That!","description":"Seria confronts Algmos. Grahdens and the Summoner ignore Seria\'s wish of fighting alone, and join the battle.","category":51003,"order":9,"script":"grand_04_06","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000003}},{"id":50407,"title":"Thank Me with Tears!","description":"Lugina and the Summoner arrive just when Seria is about to confront Algmos, and join the fight without anyone asking them to.","category":51003,"order":14,"script":"grand_04_07","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000003}},{"id":50408,"title":"Worried About Seria","description":"As Tilith guards Seria from harm, she reminds her that there are people who worry about her now, in the present.","category":51003,"order":5,"script":"grand_04_08","music":"bf015_map_wilds.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000003}},{"id":50409,"title":"Bearing a Burden","description":"Algmos gets away. While Seria dwells in her past Grahdens advises her to embrace her pain, and to bear the responsibility of her burden.","category":51003,"order":10,"script":"grand_04_09","music":"bf015_map_wilds.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000003}},{"id":50410,"title":"Quit Messing Around!","description":"Algmos escapes while Seria and Lugina argue. Seria is stumped by Lugina\'s sound reasoning, but...","category":51003,"order":15,"script":"grand_04_10","music":"bf015_map_wilds.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000003}},{"id":50411,"title":"Revoking Remarks","description":"Though worried about Tilith\'s physical state, Seria finally makes up her mind and asks the Summoner for help once again.","category":51003,"order":6,"script":"grand_04_11","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000003}},{"id":50412,"title":"Blade of Farewells","description":"Persuaded by Grahdens\'s advice Seria decides to face Algmos not in order to gain retribution, but to finally let go of her past.","category":51003,"order":11,"script":"grand_04_12","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000003}},{"id":50413,"title":"Help Me!","description":"Without giving it a second thought, Seria declares that she\'s going after Algmos and asks Lugina for his help with the dangerous task.","category":51003,"order":16,"script":"grand_04_13","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000003}},{"id":50414,"title":"Worried About Me","description":"Seria defeats Algmos and grows greatly as a person after pondering the meaning of Tilith\'s heartfelt message.","category":51003,"order":7,"script":"grand_04_14","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000003}},{"id":50415,"title":"Learning to Trust","description":"After defeating Algmos with Grahdens\'s help, Seria declares that she will no longer fear placing her trust in others.","category":51003,"order":12,"script":"grand_04_15","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000003}},{"id":50416,"title":"Maybe You\'re Right","description":"Having defeated Algmos, Seria gives Lugina all the credit, and even thanks him for his assistance. When Lugina is subjected to this, he...","category":51003,"order":17,"script":"grand_04_16","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000003}},{"id":50500,"title":"Grahdens\'s Request","description":"Grahdens speaks to the Summoner in the Imperial Capital Randall. Without giving away too many details, he asks the Summoner for help with something.","category":51004,"order":1,"script":"grand_05_op","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000004}},{"id":50501,"title":"Training Aide","description":"Grahdens\'s real purpose is to defeat the demon Mashreed, but before he can do that, the number of surrounding demons in the area must be contained.","category":51004,"order":2,"script":"grand_05_01","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000004}},{"id":50502,"title":"Windswept Town","description":"Grahdens defeats a demon in the Windswept Town. He states that the fight hardly qualified as a warm up, as if his opponent had been a breeze.","category":51004,"order":3,"script":"grand_05_02","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000004}},{"id":50503,"title":"Inferno Forest","description":"Grahdens defeats a demon in the Inferno Forest. He states that the fight hardly qualified as a warm up, as if his opponent had been a breeze.","category":51004,"order":4,"script":"grand_05_03","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000004}},{"id":50504,"title":"Halcyon Plains","description":"Grahdens defeats a demon in the Halcyon Plains. He states that the fight hardly qualified as a warm up, as if his opponent had been a breeze.","category":51004,"order":5,"script":"grand_05_04","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000004}},{"id":50505,"title":"Stormswept Metropolis","description":"Grahdens defeats a demon in the Stormswept Metropolis. He states that the fight hardly qualified as a warm up, as if his opponent had been a breeze.","category":51004,"order":6,"script":"grand_05_05","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000004}},{"id":50506,"title":"Mashreed\'s Presence","description":"Grahdens\'s fighting instinct slowly returns to him. He can sense Mashreed\'s strong presence, and yet another powerful one in the area.","category":51004,"order":8,"script":"grand_05_06","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000004}},{"id":50507,"title":"Need More Time","description":"The Summoner defeats a demon in the Shadow Temple. Grahdens, who was lagging behind, states he needs more time to recover his fighting instinct.","category":51004,"order":7,"script":"grand_05_07","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000004}},{"id":50508,"title":"Strong Opponent","description":"Grahdens encounters an unexpectedly strong opponent. However, he deems it the perfect opponent to fully restore his fighting instinct.","category":51004,"order":9,"script":"grand_05_08","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000004}},{"id":50509,"title":"At the Front Lines","description":"The battle has ended and Grahdens has regained his pride as a Summoner. He vows to fight in the frontlines from now on as well.","category":51004,"order":10,"script":"grand_05_09","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000004}},{"id":50510,"title":"Winged Demon","description":"The Summoner and Grahdens finally meet Mashreed. Grahdens challenges the demon to see if its strength truly lives up to its reputation.","category":51004,"order":11,"script":"grand_05_10","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000004}},{"id":50511,"title":"Mashreed Flees","description":"Mashreed runs from Grahdens in the heat of battle. Grahdens is highly disappointed, but decides to go after it just in case...","category":51004,"order":12,"script":"grand_05_11","music":"bf015_map_wilds.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000004}},{"id":50512,"title":"The Real Battle","description":"Mashreed has changed its shape, becoming more intimidating than ever. Knowing the real fight is about to begin, Grahdens\'s fighting spirit swells.","category":51004,"order":13,"script":"grand_05_12","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000004}},{"id":50513,"title":"Prepare for Battle!","description":"Grahdens defeats Mashreed and encourages the Summoner, who is astonished by the power the Elder Summoner displayed, to head towards Ishgria.","category":51004,"order":14,"script":"grand_05_13","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000004}},{"id":50600,"title":"Request for an Escort","description":"Lin asks the Summoner to accompany her during a land survey in Elgaia. She says if the Summoner is around, she will have nothing to worry about.","category":51005,"order":1,"script":"grand_06_op","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000005}},{"id":50601,"title":"The Survey Begins!","description":"Lin states that they must explore four areas to complete the survey, and that if she becomes unable to continue, the survey will be deemed a failure.","category":51005,"order":2,"script":"grand_06_01","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000005}},{"id":50602,"title":"Cloth Melting Mucus","description":"Lin\'s clothes are melted by the mucus secreted by a certain demon. Seeing herself in a pinch, she asks the Summoner for help.","category":51005,"order":3,"script":"grand_06_02","music":"bf014_map_swamp.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000005}},{"id":50603,"title":"Coiling Tentacles","description":"Lin is rendered unable to move by what seem like tentacles tangled around her feet. The Summoner manages to rescue her, but now she\'s soaking wet...","category":51005,"order":4,"script":"grand_06_03","music":"bf052_map_mgc_swamp.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000005}},{"id":50604,"title":"Cloth Shredding Beak","description":"A demon with a beak starts tearing Lin\'s clothes apart. The Summoner manages to defeat the demon, but ends up in rags worse than Lin\'s.","category":51005,"order":5,"script":"grand_06_04","music":"bf018_map_sand.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000005}},{"id":50605,"title":"Last Survey Area","description":"Lin inspects the setting of the last survey area. The party is surrounded by demons in a flash, though they\'re excited to bring the survey to its end.","category":51005,"order":6,"script":"grand_06_05","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000005}},{"id":50606,"title":"Counterattack\'s Effect","description":"The Summoner continues battling all surrounding demons, until the last one of them lands a desperate final attack...","category":51005,"order":7,"script":"grand_06_06","music":"bf011_map_firecave.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000005}},{"id":50607,"title":"Tarnished Reputation","description":"A few days after Lin\'s survey comes to its end, the Summoner faces a lot of intriguing cold stares back in the Imperial Capital...","category":51005,"order":8,"script":"grand_06_07","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000005}},{"id":50700,"title":"Childhood Memories","description":"Paris dreams of her early childhood as she dozes off in the Imperial Library. Meanwhile, Noel suddenly appears...","category":51006,"order":1,"script":"grand_07_op","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50701,"title":"Temple of Illusions","description":"Paris heads towards the Temple of Illusions and runs into the Summoner, who says is in the area on an urgent mission from Summoners\' Hall.","category":51006,"order":2,"script":"grand_07_01","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50702,"title":"Zebra Reappears","description":"As the Summoner approaches the Temple of Illusions, a blinding light suddenly appears, somehow bringing with it the once defeated disciple Zebra.","category":51006,"order":3,"script":"grand_07_02","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50703,"title":"Demon\'s Abilities","description":"The Summoner defeats Zebra once again. Lin says she thinks his appearance could be connected to the demon dwelling within the Temple of Illusions.","category":51006,"order":4,"script":"grand_07_03","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50704,"title":"Mare Reappears","description":"The disciple Mare shows herself anew before the Summoner. Wielding powers greater than those of a god, she asks about the Summoner\'s destination.","category":51006,"order":5,"script":"grand_07_04","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50705,"title":"Humanity\'s Limits","description":"Mare is defeated by the Summoner once more. As she laughs, she predicts that the Summoner will one day be destroyed by powerless beings.","category":51006,"order":6,"script":"grand_07_05","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50706,"title":"Zurg Reappears","description":"The disciple Zurg also shows himself, just as Mare had. He says that humans have no hope of governing Grand Gaia.","category":51006,"order":7,"script":"grand_07_06","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50707,"title":"Manifested Fears","description":"After the Summoner defeats Zurg, Lin discloses that the power of the demon awaiting in the temple may be that of manifesting one\'s fears.","category":51006,"order":8,"script":"grand_07_07","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50708,"title":"Four Great Powers","description":"The Summoner finally reaches the Temple of Illusions, but just when four strong presences are sensed in the area, communication with Lin goes awry...","category":51006,"order":9,"script":"grand_07_08","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50709,"title":"Four Fallen Gods","description":"The Summoner ends up defeating the Four Fallen Gods instead of the demon. The real demon gets away, but the mission is considered clear for now.","category":51006,"order":10,"script":"grand_07_09","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50710,"title":"Bitter Reunion","description":"Eriole suddenly shows himself before Paris. He chastises her and challenges her to a battle she doesn\'t want to fight.","category":51006,"order":11,"script":"grand_07_10","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50711,"title":"Eriole Vanishes","description":"The Eriole Paris had been fighting suddenly disappears. Without even considering that it was all an illusion, Paris goes forth amidst the confusion.","category":51006,"order":12,"script":"grand_07_11","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50712,"title":"Resentful Meeting","description":"Tesla appears before Paris. Berating her for having been born a noble, Tesla brands Paris her enemy, as well as Eriole\'s.","category":51006,"order":13,"script":"grand_07_12","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50713,"title":"Tesla Vanishes","description":"Just like Eriole, Tesla also disappears. Without comprehending what is going on around her, Paris continues heading towards the temple.","category":51006,"order":14,"script":"grand_07_13","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50714,"title":"Eriole\'s Temptation","description":"Eriole appears once more and tries to persuade Paris to join him anew. However, he is suddenly attacked by a mysterious light...","category":51006,"order":15,"script":"grand_07_14","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50715,"title":"Friendship for All","description":"Eriole explains to Paris the type of world he wants to build. However, it is then that Paris remembers the words of her dear childhood friend...","category":51006,"order":16,"script":"grand_07_15","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50716,"title":"Not Fooled by Visions","description":"After seeing Eriole transform, Paris finally realizes her enemies have been illusions. Now she is more determined to move forth than ever before!","category":51006,"order":17,"script":"grand_07_16","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50717,"title":"My Own Power...","description":"Paris destroys the demon behind all the illusions, and vows to live her life by helping those who are in need of her power.","category":51006,"order":18,"script":"grand_07_17","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50718,"title":"My Ideal World","description":"Paris finally learns her new purpose after defeating Eriole. However, there is a strong presence emanating from the Temple of Illusions...","category":51006,"order":21,"script":"grand_07_18","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50719,"title":"Growing Fear","description":"After Paris regroups with the Summoner, Lin explains the characteristics of the demon. They head towards the temple to defeat it, but...","category":51006,"order":22,"script":"grand_07_19","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50720,"title":"Paris Moves On","description":"With the demon defeated, Paris confesses to the Summoner that it may be good for her to start seeing things from different points of view.","category":51006,"order":23,"script":"grand_07_20","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50721,"title":"Doubts & Expectations","description":"After fighting against the illusions, Paris rediscovers the doubt within her. However, she feels that these doubts are what led her there.","category":51006,"order":19,"script":"grand_07_21","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50722,"title":"Follow Your Own Path","description":"Paris is not surprised in the least to learn she had been fighting against illusions. Instead, she focuses on a way to make her own dreams a reality.","category":51006,"order":20,"script":"grand_07_22","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000006}},{"id":50800,"title":"Noel & Rhynt\'s Secret","description":"Noel and Rhynt talk about powering up their new mock Units, but they somehow need Lugina to battle a demon with very particular powers to do so.","category":51007,"order":1,"script":"grand_08_op","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000007}},{"id":50801,"title":"Abandoned Metropolis","description":"The Summoner goes after the demon alongside Lugina. Karl also happens to be in the area fulfilling an urgent request from Grahdens.","category":51007,"order":2,"script":"grand_08_01","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000007}},{"id":50802,"title":"Fake Lugina","description":"Lugina runs into an opponent who looks exactly like him. As the fake Lugina provokes the real one, a battle ensues.","category":51007,"order":3,"script":"grand_08_02","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000007}},{"id":50803,"title":"Impostor\'s Escape","description":"The fake Lugina says he\'s the real deal in both mind and spirit. However, the real Lugina has yet to simmer down, and immediately attacks the fake.","category":51007,"order":4,"script":"grand_08_03","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000007}},{"id":50804,"title":"Reply to Provocation","description":"As the fake Lugina tries to provoke the original, Lugina fires back with taunts of his own. The anger each of them feels fuels yet another brawl.","category":51007,"order":5,"script":"grand_08_04","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000007}},{"id":50805,"title":"Lugina\'s Real Power","description":"The fake Lugina is defeated by the real Lugina. He flees saying that he wants to learn to control his current body and spirit more efficiently.","category":51007,"order":6,"script":"grand_08_05","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000007}},{"id":50806,"title":"Lin\'s Demon Intel","description":"Lin informs the Summoner about the target demon. She says it\'s possible that it has taken on Lugina\'s shape.","category":51007,"order":10,"script":"grand_08_06","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000007}},{"id":50807,"title":"Karl\'s Guess","description":"Karl heads towards the Abandoned Metropolis alone. Hearing that other personnel has been dispatched to the area, he gets a hunch as to who it is.","category":51007,"order":12,"script":"grand_08_07","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000007}},{"id":50808,"title":"The Demon Nebulous","description":"Caught in a mad frenzy, the fake Lugina shows his true demonic nature. Lugina, who is also burning with rage, triggers a fight.","category":51007,"order":7,"script":"grand_08_08","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000007}},{"id":50809,"title":"Two Luginas","description":"Karl and the Summoner are confused by Lugina\'s fake. However, after the real Lugina insults them they realize who\'s the original and fight together.","category":51007,"order":8,"script":"grand_08_09","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000007}},{"id":50810,"title":"Lugina\'s Personality","description":"Lugina defeats the demon Nebulous, and instead of this victory humbling him, it gives his personality a turn for the worse...","category":51007,"order":9,"script":"grand_08_10","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000007}},{"id":50811,"title":"Meeting Fake Lugina","description":"The Summoner is suddenly attacked by Lugina upon arriving to the Abandoned Metropolis, but can immediately tell this opponent is a fake.","category":51007,"order":11,"script":"grand_08_11","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000007}},{"id":50812,"title":"Fake Lugina Attacks","description":"Upon arriving to his destination, Karl runs into Lugina\'s fake. Unprovoked by the impostor, he accepts the challenge while keeping his cool.","category":51007,"order":13,"script":"grand_08_12","music":"bf050_raid02_fld.mp3","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000007}},{"id":50813,"title":"Noel\'s Miscalculation","description":"Noel and Rhynt, who concocted the plan to have Lugina fight Nebulous, are confused as to why Karl was in the area.","category":51007,"order":14,"script":"grand_08_13","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000007}},{"id":50814,"title":"Karl Waits for Lugina","description":"After Karl repels the fake Lugina\'s attack, he wonders why Grahdens has sent him on this mission, and waits for the real Lugina\'s arrival.","category":51007,"order":15,"script":"grand_08_14","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000007}},{"id":50815,"title":"Karl\'s Defense","description":"Lugina goes after the demon with Karl. Awaiting them, the demon mentions an incident involving Zagamlung, and Karl intervenes on Lugina\'s behalf.","category":51007,"order":16,"script":"grand_08_15","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000007}},{"id":50816,"title":"Exploding Antagonism","description":"Lugina gets angry at Karl for unwantedly sticking up for him and challenges him to a duel. Karl can see that Lugina is serious, so he accepts.","category":51007,"order":17,"script":"grand_08_16","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000007}},{"id":50817,"title":"Lugina VS. Karl","description":"Lugina claims Karl is no match for him after Karl is seemingly unable to fight to the best of his ability. But according to Karl...","category":51007,"order":18,"script":"grand_08_17","trigger":{"kind":"grand","archiveId":5000007}}]}')}]);